{
  "name": "Enrich every new HubSpot contact with job title, company and profile URL",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Enrich every new HubSpot contact with job title, company and profile URL\n\n### How it works\nEvery new contact, complete within a minute. The HubSpot Trigger fires on contact creation. The workflow reads the contact's email and asks Argorant for the person behind it. When Argorant finds a match with a passing email, the contact is updated with job title, company name, seniority, city, country and profile URL. Contacts without a match stay as they are, so nothing is overwritten with guesses. Free mail addresses rarely match; that is expected.\n\nCosts: 1 credit per match; misses are free.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the community node **n8n-nodes-argorant** (tested with 0.3.0 on n8n 2.46.6): Settings > Community nodes > Install. Guide: https://github.com/argorant/n8n-nodes-argorant\n2. Add an **Argorant API** credential with a key from Argorant (Settings, API keys).\n3. Add a HubSpot Developer API credential to **New contact** and a HubSpot App Token credential (private app, contacts read and write) to **Get the email** and **Update the contact**.\n4. Activate the workflow.\n\n### Customization\nSkip contacts that already have a job title, or write to custom properties instead.",
        "height": 609,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "bbe0a44a-e490-42a5-9faa-21918743272e",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -620,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Read the contact\nThe trigger sends the ID; the email comes from HubSpot.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "e3c48525-3afe-48cc-8dc3-1da22e76066f",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        -140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Enrich\n1 credit per match with a passing email. Misses leave the contact as it is.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "50ce8c78-4bc6-49bf-b72e-2125bcb95f32",
      "name": "Sticky Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        -140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "eventsUi": {
          "eventValues": [
            {
              "name": "contact.creation"
            }
          ]
        },
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "e4c7effd-734b-4b0b-a8cf-b17befe8ceee",
      "name": "New contact",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.hubspotTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "e35316e1-07d9-493b-ad01-6cedaba0b68c"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "appToken",
        "resource": "contact",
        "operation": "get",
        "contactId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "={{ $json.objectId }}"
        },
        "additionalFields": {
          "propertiesCollection": {
            "propertiesValues": {
              "properties": [
                "email"
              ],
              "propertyMode": "valueOnly"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "e072f43e-e5fa-4b07-a2e9-ff8d94baad49",
      "name": "Get the email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.hubspot",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "d077d4f6-29b7-460a-aa3a-2c985ca66ac4",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.properties.email.value }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              },
              "rightValue": ""
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "5bb381a9-02c5-41a8-a9d9-020288cfc2d4",
      "name": "Has an email?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "lead",
        "operation": "enrich",
        "enrichBy": "email",
        "email": "={{ $json.properties.email.value }}",
        "simplify": true
      },
      "id": "4a244bb4-f0d6-4af7-bc09-2510496d3be2",
      "name": "Find the person",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-argorant.argorant",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        720,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "88fec384-a33b-4b17-8fe6-ea33a7878edc",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.found }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              },
              "rightValue": ""
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "732aecc6-0c3c-430b-b25e-3a8b516c472b",
      "name": "Found?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        960,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "appToken",
        "resource": "contact",
        "operation": "upsert",
        "email": "={{ $('Get the email').item.json.properties.email.value }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "jobTitle": "={{ $json.title }}",
          "companyName": "={{ $json.company }}",
          "seniority": "={{ $json.seniority }}",
          "city": "={{ $json.city }}",
          "country": "={{ $json.country }}",
          "linkedinUrl": "={{ $json.linkedin_url }}"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "ea29e038-c627-438e-8cfd-0484d9727641",
      "name": "Update the contact",
